@startuml 04-dataflow
!theme plain
title 4. 主数据流：一个 poll tick —— 行号在 HEAD dbbac03 上实测

actor "QTimer::timeout\nmain.cpp:458" as T

box "startup (once)" #F5F3FF
  participant "main.cpp:392\ncreateReader(gameId, explicitMap, dataDirs)" as S1
  participant "reader_factory.cpp:24\nswitch(game) → one reader" as S2
end box

participant "MhwReader\n(world_reader.cpp:215)" as RW
participant "MhrReader\n(mhr_reader.cpp:1311)" as RR

participant "GameSnapshot" as SNAP #F3F4F6

participant "PlayerPanel\npanel_player.cpp:539" as PP
participant "MonsterPanel\npanel_monster.cpp:760" as MP
participant "DamagePanel / PetDamagePanel\npanel_damage.cpp:182-663" as DP

T -> S1 : startup
S1 -> S2
S2 -> RW : GameId::World\nmake_unique<MhwReader>\n(selectLoadableMap(worldMapCandidates(…)))\nfactory :35-40
S2 -> RR : GameId::Rise\nmake_unique<MhrReader>\n(findBestMap(versionedMapCandidates(…)))\nfactory :41-48

...pollMs later, every tick...

T -> T : try { snap = reader->poll() }\ncatch (…) → skip frame\nmain.cpp:476-485 整个 tick 的异常屏障

T -> RW : World
T -> RR : Rise

RW --> SNAP : GameSnapshot\nzone = ZoneRef{World, (int)worldZone} :225
RR --> SNAP : GameSnapshot\nzone = ZoneRef{Rise, rawId} :1320

SNAP -> PP : playerPanel.update(snap)\nmain.cpp:505\n镜像 9 字段，然后\nPlayerViewModel::resolveIdentity(snap) :566
SNAP -> MP : selectMonsterTarget(snap.monsters,\ndisplayedMonsterAddress)\ntarget_selector.cpp（编进 game-world）\n→ monsterPanel.update(snap.monsters[selected]) :527

SNAP -> DP : World：damagePanel.update(snap) :663\n（先过 visibleDamageParty 过滤 showOtherMembers）
SNAP -> DP : Rise：3× RiseDamageReader::update()\n仲裁见 06-damage-arbitration\n→ enrichRiseDamageSnapshot(dmg, snap)\nrise_damage_roster.cpp:84\n→ damagePanel.updateRiseDamage(dmg) :593\n→ petDamagePanel.updateRiseDamage(dmg) :595

PP -> PP : setVisible(panelEnabled() && hasVisibleContent())\ntriggerUpdate() → paintEvent\n→ paintPanel(QPainter&) panel.h:142

note over T
两条路径的差异只有这些（其余逐行相同）：
· 取 map：World 逐候选试到能解析（FirstLoadable）；Rise 先探测运行中游戏（BestWithProbe）
· 区域：World 传原始 int32（只过滤 0..1000）；Rise 还会产出 -2 LoadingScreen / 199 CharSelection
· DamagePanel 的源：World = 本帧 snap.party；Rise = REFramework JSON feed（out-of-band，3 个文件槽）
· PetDamagePanel：只有 Rise 会构造并推送
· 残留的 isRise（main.cpp:305）只为这两项 Rise 独有功能存在，按 §3.5 的理由不做成能力查询

edit/demo 模式：skipUpdate(Panel) = editMode && panel.demoPrimed()（main.cpp:496）
  只 triggerUpdate()，不投递 reader 快照，避免把 demo 状态擦掉
end note

@enduml
